{"4454430":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Planet Killer","steam_appid":4454430,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4788860],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Planet Killer.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek hostile worlds.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reduce them to molten ash.<br><br>Planet Killer is a physics-driven destruction roguelite where every shot permanently reshapes the battlefield. Unleash devastating weapons into fully simulated pixel-based planets, carve massive craters, trigger chain reactions, and survive relentless planetary defenses with up to 6-player online co-op.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your starting ship, each with unique strengths and weaknesses, and unlock new ships by destroying planets.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEVASTATING PLANETARY DESTRUCTION<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4454430\/extras\/ac41ea01381b0d24b0bd13cb3993d9c8.poster.avif?t=1791166664\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4454430\/extras\/ac41ea01381b0d24b0bd13cb3993d9c8.webm?t=1791166664\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4454430\/extras\/ac41ea01381b0d24b0bd13cb3993d9c8.mp4?t=1791166664\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully simulated destructible planets<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time crater carving and shockwaves<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain explosions and cascading destruction<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shot leaves a permanent impact<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrain fractures. Defenses collapse. Worlds crumble beneath sustained bombardment.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GALAXY OF UNIQUE WORLDS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced procedural planet generation makes every planet unique with detailed cities, surface features, cloud\/storm systems, continents, islands, and oceans. Even the background of space is unique with various star fields, nebula, and galaxies.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ESCALATING PLANETARY DEFENSES<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4454430\/extras\/8a70e5a8eb463a0a2f834017b1f306d5.poster.avif?t=1791166664\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4454430\/extras\/8a70e5a8eb463a0a2f834017b1f306d5.webm?t=1791166664\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4454430\/extras\/8a70e5a8eb463a0a2f834017b1f306d5.mp4?t=1791166664\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planets fight back.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surface cannons<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missile batteries<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defensive countermeasures<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasingly dangerous worlds<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR LOADOUT<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4454430\/extras\/a7867f36eee8d540b038c33aee08561e.avif?t=1791166664\" width=750 height=499 \/><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack hundreds of modular weapons to create devastating combinations<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missiles, cannons, lasers, rapid-fire barrages, experimental weapons<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defensive\/Utility modules for limitless build variety<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your build to counter evolving planetary defenses<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run offers new upgrades, new strategies, and new ways to annihilate.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROGUELITE PROGRESSION<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4454430\/extras\/2f1ee1e71b7f85467b98c6415a3bc5c0.avif?t=1791166664\" width=1158 height=809 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run pushes you deeper into hostile space.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated encounters<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing difficulty and deadlier planetary variants<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elite planets, storm worlds, and bosses<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A galactic shop to buy weapons, modules, and ship upgrades<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent run-based death<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rank up your unique Planet Killer emblem and title<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-score chasing destruction<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock over 128 unique starting ships for endless replayability<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chart your path, upgrade your ship, and see how far you can get<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How many worlds can you erase before you fall?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Planet Killer.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek hostile worlds.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reduce them to molten ash.<br><br>Planet Killer is a physics-driven destruction roguelite where every shot permanently reshapes the battlefield. Unleash devastating weapons into fully simulated pixel-based planets, carve massive craters, trigger chain reactions, and survive relentless planetary defenses with up to 6-player online co-op.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your starting ship, each with unique strengths and weaknesses, and unlock new ships by destroying planets.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEVASTATING PLANETARY DESTRUCTION<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4454430\/extras\/ac41ea01381b0d24b0bd13cb3993d9c8.poster.avif?t=1791166664\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4454430\/extras\/ac41ea01381b0d24b0bd13cb3993d9c8.webm?t=1791166664\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4454430\/extras\/ac41ea01381b0d24b0bd13cb3993d9c8.mp4?t=1791166664\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully simulated destructible planets<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time crater carving and shockwaves<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain explosions and cascading destruction<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shot leaves a permanent impact<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrain fractures. Defenses collapse. Worlds crumble beneath sustained bombardment.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GALAXY OF UNIQUE WORLDS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced procedural planet generation makes every planet unique with detailed cities, surface features, cloud\/storm systems, continents, islands, and oceans. Even the background of space is unique with various star fields, nebula, and galaxies.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ESCALATING PLANETARY DEFENSES<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4454430\/extras\/8a70e5a8eb463a0a2f834017b1f306d5.poster.avif?t=1791166664\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4454430\/extras\/8a70e5a8eb463a0a2f834017b1f306d5.webm?t=1791166664\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4454430\/extras\/8a70e5a8eb463a0a2f834017b1f306d5.mp4?t=1791166664\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planets fight back.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surface cannons<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missile batteries<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defensive countermeasures<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasingly dangerous worlds<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR LOADOUT<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4454430\/extras\/a7867f36eee8d540b038c33aee08561e.avif?t=1791166664\" width=750 height=499 \/><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack hundreds of modular weapons to create devastating combinations<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missiles, cannons, lasers, rapid-fire barrages, experimental weapons<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defensive\/Utility modules for limitless build variety<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your build to counter evolving planetary defenses<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run offers new upgrades, new strategies, and new ways to annihilate.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROGUELITE PROGRESSION<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4454430\/extras\/2f1ee1e71b7f85467b98c6415a3bc5c0.avif?t=1791166664\" width=1158 height=809 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run pushes you deeper into hostile space.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated encounters<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing difficulty and deadlier planetary variants<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elite planets, storm worlds, and bosses<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A galactic shop to buy weapons, modules, and ship upgrades<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent run-based death<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rank up your unique Planet Killer emblem and title<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-score chasing destruction<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock over 128 unique starting ships for endless replayability<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chart your path, upgrade your ship, and see how far you can get<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How many worlds can you erase before you fall?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"A physics-driven sci-fi destruction roguelite. Orbit hostile worlds, unleash devastating weapons, and carve real craters into fully simulated planets while escalating planetary defenses fight back.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4454430\/1c461ef7aa009b39ef6bbe92e5de45cc807583c9\/header.jpg?t=1791166664","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4454430\/8a2a150610426bcce301c330a4c2a6cce9d619d3\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1791166664","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4454430\/8a2a150610426bcce301c330a4c2a6cce9d619d3\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1791166664","website":"https:\/\/talismanonestudio.vercel.app\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<str